---
/**
 * privacy-policy.astro — Privacy Policy Page
 * Expanded with Google DART cookies, AdSense disclosures, and cookie controls.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — FreeFileTools"
  description="Read the FreeFileTools Privacy Policy. We guarantee 100% browser-side client processing with zero file uploads. Includes Google AdSense and DART cookie disclosures."
>
  <article class="page-container">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: August 2026 · Effective immediately</p>
    </header>

    <div class="page-body">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Zero Server Upload Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          At FreeFileTools, your privacy is our highest priority. All file conversion and image compression processes take place <strong>100% locally inside your web browser</strong> using JavaScript, HTML5 Canvas, and WebAssembly technologies running entirely within your device's RAM.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your files, images, documents, and data are <strong>never uploaded, transmitted, stored, or processed on any cloud server or remote infrastructure</strong>. The moment you close or reload the browser tab, all processed file data is immediately freed from memory by the browser's garbage collector.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Data Collection &amp; Analytics</h2>
        <p>Because all processing happens locally on your computer or mobile device:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>We do not collect, inspect, or retain your files, their filenames, or associated metadata.</li>
          <li>We do not require user account registration, login credentials, or any form of personal identification.</li>
          <li>We do not sell, rent, license, or share any personal user data with third parties for marketing purposes.</li>
          <li>We do not use fingerprinting, behavioral tracking scripts, or cross-site tracking technologies.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Local Storage &amp; Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          FreeFileTools uses browser <code>localStorage</code> solely to persist local UI preferences (e.g., your last-used output format). No personally identifiable tracking cookies or advertising profile identifiers are set by our own application code.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not use session cookies to track your browsing behavior across pages.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Google AdSense &amp; Third-Party Advertising Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          FreeFileTools participates in the <strong>Google AdSense</strong> advertising program to help fund free tool development. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on our site. Google's use of the <strong>DART cookie</strong> enables it to serve ads to users based on their visit to our site and other sites on the Internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          Specifically:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>DART Cookie:</strong> Google uses the DoubleClick DART cookie to serve ads across websites and apps that use AdSense. This cookie is used by Google to display ads based on a user's prior visit to our website and other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li><strong>Advertising Partners:</strong> Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technologies such as cookies, JavaScript, or web beacons that are used in their respective advertisements and links that appear on FreeFileTools, which are sent directly to users' browsers. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs.</li>
          <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> These technologies are used to measure the effectiveness of ad campaigns and/or to personalize the advertising content that you see on websites that you visit.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Users may opt out of the use of the DART cookie by visiting the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google ad and content network Privacy Policy</a>. You may also visit <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info/choices</a> to opt out of interest-based advertising from participating companies.
        </p>
        <p>
          FreeFileTools has no access to or control over the cookies that are used by third-party advertisers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Cookie Control &amp; Browser Settings</h2>
        <p>
          You can control and/or delete cookies as you wish using your browser settings. You can delete all cookies that are already on your computer and you can set most browsers to prevent them from being placed.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Chrome:</strong> Settings → Privacy and Security → Cookies and other site data</li>
          <li><strong>Firefox:</strong> Preferences → Privacy &amp; Security → Cookies and Site Data</li>
          <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences → Privacy → Manage Website Data</li>
          <li><strong>Edge:</strong> Settings → Cookies and site permissions → Cookies and site data</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Note: If you disable cookies, some functionality of third-party services (including Google AdSense ad display) may be affected. Our core file conversion tools will continue to work without any cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to other websites. We have no control over the content and practices of those sites, and cannot accept responsibility or liability for their respective privacy policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          FreeFileTools does not knowingly collect any personal information from children under the age of 13. If you are a parent or guardian and you believe your child has provided personal information to us, please contact us so that we can take the appropriate action.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to update or change our Privacy Policy at any time. Any changes will be effective immediately upon posting the revised Privacy Policy on this page. Your continued use of the service after we post any modifications constitutes your acknowledgment of the modifications and your consent to abide by the modified Privacy Policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or the data practices of FreeFileTools, please contact us at: <a href="mailto:sajeepriyangika81@gmail.com">sajeepriyangika81@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can also visit our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a> for additional support options.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-16);
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .page-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .page-body h2 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .page-body p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-loose);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .page-body ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--line-height-loose);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .page-body code {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    color: var(--color-accent-400);
  }

  .page-body a {
    color: var(--color-brand-400);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .page-body a:hover {
    color: var(--color-brand-300);
  }
</style>
